1100 to 1100 (step 100): 2 buildings per block with footprint 25-45m, heights 20-95m, some taller towers (up to 130m) near 四条 and 駅.\n- Facade material with window emissive texture (canvas) — reuse prototype's facadeMat.\n- Buildings placed with y = h/2.\n\nA landmark: build a simplified 京都駅タワー (big curved-ish tower) near goal coords, and a 四条ビルディング tower near start? Nice touches. 京都駅: height 130m at goal position; make it a slightly tapered box tower with podium. Since the goal ring is at 175m, the tower doesn't block.\n\nNow street.ts: \n- neon signs along 烏丸通 (x = ±22), every ~160m from z=-1050..1050\n- lamps every 130m\n- cars: 12 cars driving along the street\n- stars + moon\n- wind particles\n- day/night toggle: function applyDayNight(night)\n- update(dt) for cars + wind\n\nI'll put wind particles in street.ts as well, with `updateWind(dt, playerPos, vel, fwd, active)`.\n\nLet me write city.ts now.",
