          "text": "Issues to fix in main.ts:\n1. `courseCoinsTotal` — I never set it. Course should expose `coinTotal`. Add getter.\n2. `player.dashRatio` — need to expose dash cooldown ratio from player.\n3. Coin handling: Course.update already returns coinCount and marks taken; but Player's events also had `onCoins` which I don't call from player — remove onCoins from PlayerEvents or keep unused. Better: remove onCoins from player events (course handles it).\n4. `player.setCheckpoint(gateCenters[res.hitGate])` — gateCenters for gate i is center of torii; respawn slightly above: setCheckpoint already adds +8 y. But respawning at the gate center: player would respawn inside torii — fine, above it.\n   Also for the goal gate: respawn at goal center would be weird but irrelevant (run finishes).\n   Also the onCheckpoint event in player is redundant with course.update hitGate in main. I call hud.banner in both places → double banner. Remove onCheckpoint from player (it's never called by player anyway — player never calls ev.onCheckpoint; course gate logic is in main). So drop onCheckpoint from PlayerEvents.\n5. In startRun: `const p = city.probeFinished; void p;` — remove.\n6. boot(): if tiles never load even after probe OK (e.g. tileset reachable but b3dm loading slow), we still wait 1200ms after settle. Fine — first load-model hides fallback whenever it happens.\n7. `player.reset()` before event binding? No, ok. But player.reset() called at construction-time events? no events during reset.\n8. Wind during title passes `tmpV` as fwd and zero velocity — updateWind with active=false → returns after lerping opacity down. ok but passes tmpV which is also used... it's fine.\n9. `state.time` uses performance.now() - startAt; on pause? fine.\n10. `onFall` penalizes time by +3 — but state.time is computed from performance.now delta each frame, not accumulated; penalty applied to state.time then overwritten next frame. Fix: track penalty separately: state.penalty accumulated; state.time = raw + penalty. Let me fix: in loop, `state.time = (performance.now() - state.startAt)/1000 + state.penalty;` and onFall does `state.penalty += PHYS.fallPenalty`.\n11. `finishRun` uses state.time — fine.\n12. `player.setPlaying(true)` inside startRun; during title the ninja shouldn't animate — player.setPlaying(false) initially (default false) ✓. But ninja poses 'fall' when !playing ✓.\n13. in Player.reset(): vel.set(0,0,30) — south. spawn faces south (yaw=0). ✓\n14. dashRatio: add getter in Player: `get dashRatio(): number { return this.dashCd / PHYS.dashCooldown; }` → HUD dashReady = 1 - dashRatio.\n15. Also remove `onCoins` from PlayerEvents and player never fires it.\n16. `res.coinCount` — Course returns per-frame count; main handles audio + score. But I also had `onCoins` in player events — remove.\n\nAlso fix course.ts: add `get coinTotal(): number`.\n\n17. In hud.ts I set `el.dash.style.width = clamp01(s.dashReady)*100` ✓.\n\n18. Course.update walks all coins each frame (48 coins + 5 gates) — trivial.\n\n19. `gate(index)` returns Gate type (private interface) — main uses g.label, g.goal, g.center ✓ TS fine.\n\n20. banner double: main shows banner for gates; player.onCheckpoint unused → remove.\n\n21. Also add to Player: expose `dashRatio`.\n\nLet me make these edits.",
