oUnusedLocals false — fine.\n\nNow: favicon.svg — I reference it. The repo has kph2026-07/app/public/favicon.svg. I'll create a simple ninja favicon at public/favicon.svg in the repo root (new location: kph2026-07/public/favicon.svg). I'll copy the existing one.\n\nAlso: `draco` decoder path 'draco/' — with base './' in vite build, public/draco is copied to dist/draco ✓ and relative fetch 'draco/' relative to page URL. For dev server, 'draco/' resolves relative to http://localhost:5173/draco/ ✓ works.\n\nNow: main.ts still imports `SPAWN` — used for spawnPos ✓; `LocalFrame` ✓; unused imports: `PLATEAU_CREDIT` used in status ✓. `statusMessages` unused leftover — remove.\n\nLet me view main.ts fully to clean up.",
