          "type": "text",
          "text": "Chrome is available. I'll drive it via the DevTools Protocol with a dependency-free Node script (Node 24 has built-in WebSocket) to verify the game boots, loads PLATEAU tiles, and starts without console errors:",
          "time": {
            "start": 1791618212245,
            "end": 1791618239884
